on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  3] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  4] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  7] set 4 ................................... set the volume of sound 2 to 0
  [  9] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 12] pushcons 0 .............................. <"KALENDER">
  [ 14] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <1, "KALENDER">
  [ 16] extcall 25 .............................. go(1, "KALENDER")
  [ 18] ret
end
